affiliate fees for our linear channels as well as subscription fees for our direct-to-consumer streaming services grew 3% over the prior year.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/31181054/FOX-FY2026-Q1-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q1","e":"fox","d":"2025-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"FOX News has seen strong price increases in their direct response advertising as well as for the big premium sort of branded advertising on the platform.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/31181054/FOX-FY2026-Q1-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q2","e":"fox","d":"2026-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"It is the product of both a highly differentiated strategy and high-quality execution that reflect the power of our leadership brands across news, sports, streaming and entertainment.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/05213924/FOX-FY2026-Q2-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q2","e":"fox","d":"2026-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"These patterns reinforce our view that FOX One is not only the premier destination for live sports, but also the leading platform for timely, relevant live news streaming.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/05213924/FOX-FY2026-Q2-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q3","e":"fox","d":"2026-05-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"These attracted robust audiences consuming live on the network and were amplified with meaningful levels of delayed digital streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/fox-fox-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q3","e":"fox","d":"2026-05-11","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Morris","x":"And then more broadly on the topic, there was an article recently in the Journal saying that Rupert Murdoch expressed concern to the administration about games moving -- NFL games moving to streaming services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/fox-fox-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q4","e":"fox","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"We successfully launched our direct-to-consumer streaming service, FOX One; broadcast the FIFA Men's World Cup to record audiences in the U.S.; continued to keep America informed through a dynamic and fast-moving news cycle; enhanced Tubi’s position as a leading streaming service; and announced…","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06205327/FOX-FY2026-Q4-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q4","e":"fox","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"For example, from when we acquired Tubi in its early stages, we have turned it into a leading streaming platform with 10 times the revenue from when we started.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06205327/FOX-FY2026-Q4-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2026 Q4","e":"fox","d":"2026-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Hodulik","x":"I think there's a lot of expectations that you would see a price increase either up for this season or for next season.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06205327/FOX-FY2026-Q4-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2027 Q1","e":"fox","d":"2026-11-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Lachlan Murdoch","x":"Combining Roku’s leading streaming platform with our premium sports, news, and entertainment content will build our position in the fastest-growing segments of the media landscape and will deliver both sustained growth for the company and value for our shareholders.","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02213152/FOX-FY2027-Q1-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"FOX 2027 Q1","e":"fox","d":"2026-11-02","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Morris","x":"I'm wondering why these bundles haven't been impactful and what you might need to see to strike a deeper distribution agreement with a large streaming platform?","url":"https://media.investor.foxcorporation.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02213152/FOX-FY2027-Q1-Earnings-Call-Transcript.pdf"}],"trends":{"theater":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"cinema":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"imax":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"streaming":[[63,1,4657,3,3,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,7,7,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,2,1,1,3749,502],[66,1,5087,8,8,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,2,1,1,2976,532]],"dtc":[[63,1,4657,2,2,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,1,1,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"ai_spend":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"tariffs":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"pricing_power":[[63,1,4657,1,1,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,1,0,1,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"cost_cuts":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"guidance":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0,0,4497,711],[65,1,4459,0,0,0,3749,502],[66,1,5087,0,0,0,4215,640],[67,1,3717,0,0,0,2976,532]],"ai_disruption":[[63,1,4657,0,0,0,4022,427],[64,1,5436,0,0